pbwinput 1
# The Route 19 save, made on the oracle from the starter save (starter_save_b2_us.pbwinput): CONTINUE at the Aspertia
# City lookout, Hugh's battle (a trainer battle: Tepig against Oshawott; Tepig gains 94 experience points and level
# 6), the Pokemon Center (healing; 10 Poke Balls), Mom's scene (the Running Shoes), the gate to Route 19 (its gift)
# and Bianca's catching lesson on Route 19, then the field menu's SAVE beside Route 19's grass at (56,696). B advances
# the scenes' messages (none asks a question here) and, unlike A, starts no talk with whoever stands in front.
# Positions are zone (x, z) tiles; counts are GFL's frame count (sVBlankCount). On game frames. Black 2.
version b2_us
1100 START  # START in the opening skips it to the title (count 1115 on both)
